 from him is  that's like you just can't let any of  that change you you know you always have  to keep people around you that are gonna  keep you grounded  are there any habits or blake isms that  you've picked up from being on the road  of them oh my god I don't know I picked  anything up I just know that like every  time we're on stage we just want to  laugh I don't know why like cuz it's  just he's just like a goober it's just  like going up there with your big  brother or at one time we were singing  and he yells out my part like I supposed  to come and go that's right and he just  yelled up that's right I'm like that's  my part like and then we just started  laughing he's just awesome  that's a hunky tone where the boots  don't fall 9:1 yeah so before you were  touring with Blake you had also toured  with Miranda Lambert are you guys still  in touch oh my god of course I love her  her record is so great so you just  celebrated your first wedding  anniversary yes a lots changed for you  as well what's been the best part of the  first year and the hardest part of the  first year the best part is just having  your best friend with you all the time  and like when you say I do that bond  just like strengthens so much more we're  one like I have this person that's going  through it with me you know my husband  joined the service and he's been gone  for a little bit and that that part's  been hard because I just I feel like a  piece of me is gone  24/7 like like when something happens  after write it in a letter I'm like are  we back to Noah and Allie days like this  is just crazy you know  at the end of the day I'm married to an  incredible man and he's the my best  friend and yeah we might irritate each  other sometimes but who doesn't you just  announced your first headlining tour the  brave two or what can we expect fun I am  so excited I like I told my man girls I  don't care if even 50 people show up  what would probably there's more than  but I'm saying like th